:"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/deployments","created_at":"2012-12-07T13:30:23Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T11:48:01Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-11T20:11:30Z","git_url":"git://github.com/python/mypy.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:python/mypy.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/python/mypy.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/python/mypy","homepage":"https://www.mypy-lang.org/","size":77161,"stargazers_count":20064,"watchers_count":20064,"language":"Python","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":3065,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":3124,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["linter","python","typechecker","types","typing"],"visibility":"public","forks":3065,"open_issues":3124,"watchers":20064,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"A recent change (#104) fixed some issues related to function objects as data attributes, but it broke other cases.\n\nThere are two different ways of associating data attributes with callable values:\n1. class-level: when accessing via instance, create bound method (implicit self)\n2. instance-level: when accessing via instance, return value as such\n\nThe fix to #104 fixed 1 but broke 2. \n\nHere is a simple idea for fixing also 2 (but we may eventually need a better long-term solution):\n- callable data attributes have a flag determining whether they are instance or class level\n- if a data attribute with a callable type has an initializer in the class body, it is \n  automatically\n  class-level; otherwise, the data attribute is instance-level\n- perform implicit self processing only for class-level attributes (and methods; they are\n  always class-level)\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/107/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/python/mypy/issues/107/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]